OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies at paper mill in
OL,4,Asuspected accident
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 50s has died at a paper
OL,7,Fmill following a suspected industrial
OL,8,Fincident, police have said.
OL,10,FCumbria Police said it was contacted at
OL,11,F02:46 BST on Monday about the accident
OL,12,Fat Pelta Medical Papers, in Beetham,
OL,13,Fwhich supplies premium Kraft paper
OL,14,Fpackaging.
OL,16,FIt said it was seeking to establish the
OL,17,Ffull circumstances of the death.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
