OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies at paper mill in
OL,4,Asuspected accident
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe paper firm said it was cooperating
OL,7,Fwith the authorities and was not
OL,8,Fcommenting on the circumstances of the
OL,9,Fdeath "at this stage". The Health and
OL,10,FSafety Executive said it was working
OL,11,Fwith the police.
